Figure 13:Arena environment and campaign cycle.(a)Each team runs its agent on a development server (Dev) and its challenge service on a deployment server (Prod);
the attack network connects both teams, but agents can only access Prod servers over it.
Arena facilities, not agents, verify every capture and availability check.(b)After uniform pilot batches, each batch of 24 games is selected by expected information gain with 25% random exploration;
observed captures and availability refit the model, update the standings, and select the next batch.
